# The gate code beyond the lint plugin's defaults, which no gate runs while it differs from HEAD.
# The defaults name tools at the root alone, so it holds .tools, the gates' tools. It holds the
# pins of the Python tool, the Go linters' settings, module and workspace, and any Python, Go,
# bytecode or extension module. python3 -m venv imports the modules from the tree's root.
.tools
.github/lint-requirements.in
.github/lint-requirements.txt
.golangci*
go.mod
go.sum
*.go
*go.work
*go.work.sum
.config
*.py
*.pyc
*.so
